' SD-02. UC-002 먼지 우선 센서 판단
' Related Use Case: UC-002. 먼지 우선 센서 판단
' Intent: 먼지 감지를 장애물 감지보다 우선하는 판단 흐름을 표현한다.

@startuml SD_02_UC002_Dust_First_Decision
hide footbox
title SD-02 - UC-002 먼지 우선 센서 판단

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as Controller
participant "SensorState" as SensorState
participant "AutomaticCleaning" as Cleaning
participant "CleaningDecision" as Decision

Sensor -> Controller: reportSensorSnapshot(dustDetected, frontObstacleDetected, backObstacleDetected)
activate Controller
Controller -> SensorState: updateSnapshot(frontObstacleDetected, backObstacleDetected, dustDetected)
Controller -> Cleaning: decideNextAction(SensorState)
activate Cleaning

Cleaning -> SensorState: isDustDetected()
alt dustDetected = true
    SensorState --> Cleaning: true
    Cleaning -> Decision: dustResponse(currentDirection)
    Decision --> Cleaning: DUST_RESPONSE
    note right of Cleaning: 장애물 감지 여부와 관계없이 UC-003 또는 UC-004 선택
else dustDetected = false
    SensorState --> Cleaning: false
    Cleaning -> SensorState: obstacleDetectedIn(currentDirection)
    alt currentDirectionObstacle = true
        SensorState --> Cleaning: true
        Cleaning -> Decision: obstacleResponse(currentDirection)
        Decision --> Cleaning: OBSTACLE_RESPONSE
        note right of Cleaning: UC-005 또는 UC-006 선택
    else currentDirectionObstacle = false
        SensorState --> Cleaning: false
        Cleaning -> Decision: normalCleaning(currentDirection)
        Decision --> Cleaning: NORMAL_CLEANING
        note right of Cleaning: UC-001 유지
    end
end

Cleaning --> Controller: decision
deactivate Cleaning
deactivate Controller
@enduml
